The x402 + Agentic Layer (YOUR differentiation vs that other team)
Here's why x402 + agents is the killer combo:
The problem with every "AI model marketplace": A human has to browse, click, pay, copy-paste API keys, write integration code. That's Web2 with blockchain stickers.
What x402 enables: An AI agent sends an HTTP request to api.vault.ai/v1/inference/sentiment, gets back HTTP 402 Payment Required with payment details (Solana address, amount), auto-pays via Phantom, retries with payment receipt, gets result. Zero human intervention. Zero API keys. Zero accounts.
The agentic workflow:
User: "Analyze customer reviews for our product"
Agent reasoning:
  1. Need sentiment analysis → GET /models?task=sentiment&min_accuracy=90
